;; The regular-expression engine of the module _sre (PY6a; Modules/_sre/sre_lib.h's SRE(match), its semantics
;; over the code re._compiler emits): a backtracking matcher in continuation-passing style, so a repeat's
;; body, its tail and the alternatives backtrack as sre's explicit stack does. The marks (groups' bounds),
;; lastindex and lastmark are saved and restored at each backtracking point. Characters are code points
;; (str) or byte values (bytes).


